WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.460
=Episode 11=

01:09.020 --> 01:10.390
They composed a full hundred poems.

01:13.380 --> 01:14.680
What has Your Majesty discovered?

01:14.920 --> 01:15.719
Hmm.

01:22.079 --> 01:22.959
Interesting.

01:23.799 --> 01:25.519
One person wrote only of love,

01:26.120 --> 01:27.959
while the other wrote only
of lofty ambition.

01:29.159 --> 01:30.719
Women are easily consumed by love.

01:30.719 --> 01:32.690
Naturally, their poems
are filled with tenderness.

01:32.920 --> 01:33.959
Men are different.

01:34.000 --> 01:35.830
Their hearts are always
set on greater ambitions.

01:35.840 --> 01:36.959
The poems about ambition

01:37.200 --> 01:38.599
were written by Shen Zhinian.

01:39.599 --> 01:41.760
These love poems
were written by Lu Jianglin.

01:42.719 --> 01:44.760
So Lu Jianglin
is quite the hopeless romantic.

01:45.159 --> 01:46.560
If he truly were devoted,

01:46.780 --> 01:48.079
he would've stopped Shen Zhinian

01:48.079 --> 01:49.450
before she ever entered the palace.

01:49.719 --> 01:50.519
That's true.

01:50.900 --> 01:52.159
If he really were so lovestruck,

01:52.160 --> 01:53.690
he wouldn't have married Shen Nanqiao.

01:55.280 --> 01:57.319
Lu Jianglin is no threat.

01:58.439 --> 01:59.760
But this Jiang Chen...

02:00.480 --> 02:02.959
Why has he suddenly
become so attentive to Shen Zhinian?

02:03.920 --> 02:05.040
Keep an eye on him.

02:05.519 --> 02:06.280
Understood.

02:07.800 --> 02:09.950
Your Majesty should visit Physician Lu
to change your medicine.

02:09.960 --> 02:12.460
Physician Lu specifically warned
that it must not be delayed.

02:12.599 --> 02:13.439
Mm.

02:13.879 --> 02:14.759
Let's go.

02:16.580 --> 02:18.120
Luckily, I got the medicine last night.

02:18.600 --> 02:20.360
Today, Wen Ling went
to the Imperial Hospital

02:20.360 --> 02:22.120
and took away every ointment for itching.

02:22.639 --> 02:24.800
Young Master, you explained
that the rash came

02:24.960 --> 02:26.000
from insect bites today.

02:26.100 --> 02:27.790
I wonder
whether His Majesty believed him.

02:28.080 --> 02:29.199
He's far too suspicious.

02:29.660 --> 02:30.919
He won't believe it that easily.

02:31.700 --> 02:32.599
Then what should we do?

02:33.000 --> 02:34.159
He is the ruler,

02:34.400 --> 02:35.439
and I am his subject.

02:35.700 --> 02:37.780
If he refuses to trust me,
there's nothing I can do.

02:37.879 --> 02:39.759
That Shen Zhinian really is capable.

02:40.100 --> 02:42.390
She actually managed
to draw His Majesty to the Cold Palace.

02:43.100 --> 02:44.660
Not only did he go to the Cold Palace,

02:45.000 --> 02:46.800
he even tried climbing in
through the window.

02:47.280 --> 02:49.639
Shen Zhinian truly is special to him.

02:51.240 --> 02:53.990
Spread the news that His Majesty visited
the Cold Palace last night.

02:55.080 --> 02:55.800
Lady Liu,

02:55.800 --> 02:56.400
Liu Ruyan,

02:56.400 --> 02:57.080
Shen Nanqiao...

02:57.080 --> 02:58.210
Don't leave a single one out.

02:58.500 --> 03:00.790
Young Master, you have always
stayed out of harem affairs

03:01.479 --> 03:03.240
and have gotten along well
with His Majesty.

03:03.879 --> 03:06.879
Why are you suddenly
so concerned about Shen Zhinian?

03:08.199 --> 03:09.639
Because His Majesty cares about her.

03:28.400 --> 03:29.479
Lady Liu,

03:29.479 --> 03:31.360
Nanqiao is one of our Liu family.

03:31.680 --> 03:34.039
You should look after her
more in the future.

03:34.700 --> 03:37.210
Dowager Consort, be careful
not to bring trouble upon yourself.

03:37.680 --> 03:38.960
I know exactly what I'm doing.

03:46.260 --> 03:48.500
(May everlasting kindness
and glory remain)

03:49.240 --> 03:50.199
Young Master Lu,

03:50.400 --> 03:52.039
you truly write remarkable poetry.

03:52.280 --> 03:53.800
Lu began studying at the age of four.

03:54.000 --> 03:57.319
By fourteen, his poems were already
renowned throughout Chizhou.

03:57.879 --> 03:59.039
If he's such a gifted poet,

03:59.280 --> 04:00.800
why is he still relying on Shen family?

04:03.500 --> 04:05.759
Young Master Lu simply hasn't
had the right opportunity.

04:06.039 --> 04:07.159
With his talent,

04:07.439 --> 04:09.280
his day will come sooner or later.

04:09.719 --> 04:10.840
What is he, a firework?

04:11.039 --> 04:12.240
"Soaring into the sky"?

04:13.199 --> 04:14.680
Nanqiao and Jianglin

04:14.840 --> 04:16.680
saved my life.

04:17.439 --> 04:19.040
You shouldn't speak so harshly.

04:20.439 --> 04:21.319
Good children.

04:21.519 --> 04:23.000
You've kept me company all day.

04:23.240 --> 04:24.759
Go back and get some rest.

04:32.120 --> 04:34.759
Now that the Emperor
is promoting reforms

04:35.000 --> 04:36.910
and supporting scholars
from humble backgrounds,

04:36.920 --> 04:39.680
Lu Jianglin already enjoys
quite a reputation in Chizhou.

04:40.560 --> 04:41.879
If we can win him over

04:42.079 --> 04:43.600
for the Liu family,

04:44.519 --> 04:46.720
then talented scholars
of humble birth across the realm

04:47.480 --> 04:49.240
will surely flock to us.

04:49.290 --> 04:51.959
If those scholars choose to serve anyone,
they'll serve His Majesty.

04:52.260 --> 04:53.920
The Liu family
are His Majesty's subjects.

04:54.000 --> 04:55.590
How can you think of competing with him?

04:56.600 --> 04:58.160
I can't be bothered arguing with you.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.399
Go back.

05:08.560 --> 05:09.800
Among the women of the Liu clan,

05:09.959 --> 05:12.399
she is by far the most beautiful.

05:13.759 --> 05:16.079
But she's impossible to control.

05:17.319 --> 05:18.160
Dowager Consort,

05:18.279 --> 05:19.639
you still have me.

05:20.160 --> 05:22.720
I will do everything I can
to win His Majesty's favor.

05:22.920 --> 05:23.720
You?

05:23.959 --> 05:24.399
Mm.

05:24.600 --> 05:27.000
You'll already be doing well
if you stop causing trouble.

05:27.500 --> 05:29.279
You were only
just released from confinement.

05:29.439 --> 05:30.680
Behave yourself.

05:44.700 --> 05:46.959
(On the day of Beginning
of Spring in my previous life,)

05:47.480 --> 05:49.360
(the Shen family was executed in full,)

05:49.520 --> 05:51.639
(and my maternal family
was dragged down with them.)

05:52.360 --> 05:53.839
(Now I only have one month left.)

05:54.390 --> 05:56.879
(I must obtain the death-exemption medal
as soon as possible.)

06:07.519 --> 06:08.240
Young Lady,

06:08.560 --> 06:10.439
do you think His Majesty
will release us soon?

06:10.759 --> 06:12.639
Look at tonight's meal. It's so lavish.

06:32.300 --> 06:33.480
We still need to stay careful.

06:33.839 --> 06:35.279
You nearly scared me to death.

06:40.639 --> 06:41.399
Here.

06:43.300 --> 06:45.990
Young Lady, you haven't had a proper meal
since entering the Cold Palace.

06:46.160 --> 06:48.120
These two drumsticks are both for you.

06:50.600 --> 06:51.759
There are two.

06:52.199 --> 06:53.160
We'll each have one.

06:53.439 --> 06:53.920
Eat.

06:54.879 --> 06:55.439
Mm.

06:59.439 --> 07:00.600
Mm, it's delicious.

07:00.610 --> 07:01.690
Young Lady, you should eat too.

07:07.720 --> 07:08.900
The soup is delicious as well.

07:13.319 --> 07:13.959
Handan.

07:14.079 --> 07:15.160
Handan, what's wrong?

07:15.399 --> 07:15.959
Handan!

07:17.600 --> 07:18.990
I'll go fetch an imperial physician.

07:19.040 --> 07:19.639
Hold on.

07:19.839 --> 07:20.519
Wait for me.

07:21.759 --> 07:22.600
How dare you!

07:22.610 --> 07:23.990
Once you've entered the Cold Palace,

07:24.000 --> 07:26.780
without an imperial decree, you are forbidden
from stepping beyond its main gate.

07:27.199 --> 07:27.759
Move aside.

07:28.240 --> 07:29.000
Shen Zhinian,

07:29.360 --> 07:30.319
you really think

07:30.319 --> 07:31.920
His Majesty holds you dear?

07:32.240 --> 07:33.639
If His Majesty truly favored you,

07:33.639 --> 07:35.300
he wouldn't have sent you
to the Cold Palace.

07:36.199 --> 07:36.959
You vile woman!

07:37.000 --> 07:37.759
What are you doing?

07:38.120 --> 07:38.839
Let go!

07:40.360 --> 07:41.360
You madwoman!

07:41.370 --> 07:43.500
Even in the Cold Palace,
you're still this arrogant?

07:43.560 --> 07:44.759
Let me tell you something.

07:45.319 --> 07:47.879
The people sent into the Cold Palace
only leave on stretchers.

08:24.040 --> 08:24.680
Your Highness,

08:24.879 --> 08:26.000
please rest for a while.

08:43.360 --> 08:45.799
Your Highness dreamed
of immortals again last night?

08:46.440 --> 08:47.240
Mm.

08:48.799 --> 08:50.279
I dreamed that my immortal

08:50.480 --> 08:52.679
would descend on seven colored clouds
to save me

08:53.919 --> 08:54.840
and take me home.

08:55.840 --> 08:57.559
The palace is Your Highness's home.

08:57.879 --> 08:59.919
Please don't say such things outside.

09:01.399 --> 09:02.360
True.

09:03.120 --> 09:04.200
Since I'm already here,

09:05.450 --> 09:07.000
I have no choice but to keep living on.

09:09.480 --> 09:11.320
Go on. What does
His Majesty want this time?

09:12.090 --> 09:15.000
Wen Ling said His Majesty has urgent
business and must leave the palace.

09:15.010 --> 09:16.990
He asked Your Ladyship
to watch over the Cold Palace

09:17.039 --> 09:18.370
and make sure nothing goes wrong.

09:18.380 --> 09:19.540
As if he's the only busy one.

09:19.559 --> 09:20.519
Always occupied.

09:21.090 --> 09:22.960
Not only do I have to
work endlessly for him,

09:23.000 --> 09:24.390
I even have to look after his woman.

09:24.840 --> 09:25.399
Forget it.

09:25.450 --> 09:27.320
If it weren't for leaving
this miserable place,

09:28.020 --> 09:29.590
who would bother making a deal with him?

09:29.879 --> 09:30.320
Let's go.

09:30.330 --> 09:31.790
We'll take a look at the Cold Palace.

09:32.559 --> 09:34.440
Zhinian, where are you going?

09:34.720 --> 09:35.440
Move aside.

09:35.519 --> 09:36.840
Didn't you ask me to come see you?

09:36.960 --> 09:37.559
Let go of me.

09:37.560 --> 09:39.800
Nian'er, I know how much
you've suffered since childhood.

09:39.960 --> 09:40.519
Move aside.

09:40.519 --> 09:41.360
You want to rise to a higher position.

09:41.360 --> 09:41.759
Let go of me.

09:41.759 --> 09:42.360
I'm willing to help you.

09:42.370 --> 09:43.990
I only ask that you
look at me once more.

09:44.000 --> 09:44.480
Move aside.

09:44.480 --> 09:45.120
I'm warning you.

09:45.440 --> 09:46.440
Well now.

09:47.320 --> 09:48.720
One devoted lover,

09:48.879 --> 09:50.080
one ambitious schemer.

09:50.639 --> 09:52.759
Even I find the two
of you quite well matched.

09:53.200 --> 09:55.039
Your Ladyship, Handan has been poisoned.

09:55.050 --> 09:56.370
I was on my way
to fetch an imperial physician.

09:56.399 --> 09:57.330
Do you know what happens

09:57.340 --> 09:59.070
to discarded concubines who leave
the Cold Palace without permission?

09:59.080 --> 10:00.759
Take Shen Zhinian to the imperial prison.

10:00.760 --> 10:01.880
Lock her up for a few days.

10:02.600 --> 10:03.919
Lady Liu, you can't arrest her!

10:04.200 --> 10:05.559
I serve Dowager Consort Liu.

10:08.210 --> 10:09.970
Don't use the Dowager Consort
to pressure me.

10:10.159 --> 10:11.519
I answer only to His Majesty.

10:11.520 --> 10:13.470
Take Lu Jianglin
to the imperial prison as well.

10:13.559 --> 10:13.960
You...

10:15.039 --> 10:17.159
Your Ladyship,
you claim to be the fairest of all.

10:17.639 --> 10:18.279
Please,

10:18.840 --> 10:20.720
go to the Cold Palace and check on Handan.

10:21.519 --> 10:22.759
Please save her.

10:26.639 --> 10:28.879
Someone, go inspect the Cold Palace.

10:29.320 --> 10:30.840
If anyone is truly stirring up trouble,

10:31.399 --> 10:33.240
I'll personally make them pay for it.

10:33.879 --> 10:34.639
Yes.

10:35.120 --> 10:35.879
Nian'er,

10:36.200 --> 10:37.159
listen to me.

10:37.600 --> 10:39.039
I serve Dowager Consort Liu.

10:39.320 --> 10:41.159
I can definitely
find a way to get you out.

10:41.440 --> 10:42.039
Don't panic.

10:42.190 --> 10:42.879
Behave yourself.

10:42.879 --> 10:44.639
If you hadn't stopped me,

10:45.360 --> 10:47.080
how would Lady Liu have caught me?

10:48.159 --> 10:50.000
If anything happens to Handan today,

10:50.679 --> 10:51.919
I will never forgive you.

10:52.440 --> 10:53.000
Nian'er,

10:53.240 --> 10:54.919
I was framed too.

10:55.440 --> 10:56.320
Someone came to report

10:56.350 --> 10:58.279
that you had urgent matters
to discuss with me.

10:58.360 --> 10:59.720
That's why I came to see you.

11:00.080 --> 11:01.720
I was only worried about you.

11:02.200 --> 11:04.159
Why are you always so cold toward me?

11:05.519 --> 11:06.879
If I held an official post,

11:07.480 --> 11:08.840
you wouldn't treat me this way.

11:09.320 --> 11:11.280
Shouldn't you take
a good look at yourself first?

11:11.700 --> 11:12.879
Your character is disgraceful.

11:12.880 --> 11:14.000
You're heartless and disloyal.

11:14.000 --> 11:16.639
If you truly held office,
would you still even notice me?

11:17.480 --> 11:19.759
Since when did your words
become so harsh and cutting?

11:19.840 --> 11:21.440
Is that how a proper lady should speak?

11:21.759 --> 11:22.559
And a true gentleman

11:22.799 --> 11:25.600
wouldn't continue courting another woman
after getting married.

11:25.840 --> 11:26.360
I...

11:26.480 --> 11:27.080
Lu!

11:28.399 --> 11:29.000
Lu!

11:29.159 --> 11:30.000
Are you alright?

11:30.320 --> 11:31.279
Why are you here?

11:31.440 --> 11:33.120
The Dowager Consort ordered your release.

11:36.519 --> 11:37.240
Someone!

11:37.519 --> 11:38.790
By order of Dowager Consort Liu,

11:38.840 --> 11:41.120
Shen Zhinian is to receive
the tattoo punishment.

11:41.279 --> 11:41.919
Yes.

11:42.399 --> 11:43.600
Nanqiao, don't!

11:44.200 --> 11:44.900
Don't touch her!

11:45.190 --> 11:45.720
Let go of me!

11:45.720 --> 11:46.480
Don't touch her!

11:46.639 --> 11:47.600
None of you touch her!

11:53.080 --> 11:53.919
Duke Zhen,

11:54.840 --> 11:56.000
we've waited all day

11:56.000 --> 11:57.970
and His Majesty still
hasn't ordered her release.

11:58.600 --> 12:00.039
Could it be
that you guessed wrong?

12:00.040 --> 12:02.090
Perhaps His Majesty
never truly intended to favor her.

12:02.840 --> 12:05.080
As expected, I was right all along.

12:05.679 --> 12:06.440
His Majesty

12:06.480 --> 12:08.039
must not be in the palace.

12:08.200 --> 12:09.080
Not in the palace?

12:11.200 --> 12:13.679
His Majesty has been searching
for the military tally lately.

12:14.559 --> 12:17.000
He doesn't even have time
for the woman he favors.

12:17.360 --> 12:20.360
That means he's already found clues
to the tally's whereabouts.

12:21.500 --> 12:23.100
Send people to intercept him immediately.

12:23.399 --> 12:24.159
No matter what,

12:24.320 --> 12:25.840
the military tally must be recovered

12:25.840 --> 12:26.990
before he returns to the palace.

12:27.279 --> 12:27.879
Yes.

12:30.559 --> 12:31.159
Hyah!

12:33.120 --> 12:33.720
Hyah!

12:38.480 --> 12:39.080
Hyah!

13:08.720 --> 13:13.840
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

13:15.560 --> 13:20.800
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

13:22.440 --> 13:24.800
♪If we don't meet♪

13:25.000 --> 13:28.240
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

13:28.440 --> 13:34.960
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

13:35.320 --> 13:41.760
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

13:42.120 --> 13:48.440
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

13:48.960 --> 13:55.640
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

13:55.640 --> 14:02.520
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

14:02.760 --> 14:08.640
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

14:09.560 --> 14:16.160
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

14:16.320 --> 14:23.000
♪Wanting to fold my heart
into a paper kite♪

14:23.280 --> 14:29.720
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
